# Coding-agent documentation is TRACKED, not ignored: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and
# `.agent/` are the shared engineering context every agent and reviewer works from, and a
# decision log whose history does not match the code's is worthless. Do not re-add them here.
#
# What stays out is only what is genuinely personal, secret or session state:
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/sessions/
.claude/todos/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/history.jsonl
.codex/auth.json
.codex/*.local.*
.codex/sessions/
.codex/log/
*.local.toml
secrets.toml
.env
.env.*
